/ross-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Ross County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, August to September came in at 60% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far January to February sits at 43%. Grid 23290 had its driest year in 1987 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
